Setup and Connection

Before executing the queries, connect to the Teradata database environment with the appropriate credentials and ensure access to the following databases:

DATABASE RXCOE_SA;
DATABASE RXCOE_EWS;
DATABASE IDW_RX_OPERATIONS_S_BC;
DATABASE IDW_COMMON;
